{
  "key": 44594,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0463_T03PC0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "...Yeah, and the Gym in Cinnabar’s\n",
        "gone. I was really amazed.\r",
        "...Yes? I’m on the phone.\n",
        "Go away!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0463_T03PC0101_00001",
      "en_US": "Jigglypuff: Puu pupuu."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0463_T03PC0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Most Pokémon get drowsy if they\n",
        "hear a Jigglypuff singing.\r",
        "There are several moves that can be\n",
        "used only while a Pokémon is asleep."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0463_T03PC0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Aw...\n",
        "If only I had a Clefable...\r",
        "If you have a Clefable,\n",
        "you will trade it for my Espeon,\f",
        "won’t you? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0463_T03PC0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "How wonderful! You made my day!\r",
        "Thanks to you, I have finally got the\n",
        "Pokémon I’ve been looking for...\f",
        "since forever!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0463_T03PC0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "It has to be a Clefable!\r",
        "Clefable!!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0463_T03PC0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "You’d never turn down a trade\n",
        "if you had a Clefable.\r",
        "That means you just don’t have one.\n",
        "That must be it..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0463_T03PC0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "How do you like the cool Espeon\n",
        "I traded you?\r",
        "It’s so cool, because it used to be\n",
        "with cool me!\r",
        "And it knows such a\n",
        "cool move, too!!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0463_T03PC0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "After the conclusion of the trade, a\n",
        "mysterious sphere appeared in midair...\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
